{"id":"monto_n","lemma":"montón","pos":"noun","rank":544,"glosses":["heap, pile (collection of things laid in a body, or thrown together so as to form an elevation)","ton, a lot, bunch, heap, loads (a great deal; a great quantity)"],"ipa":"/monˈton/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"montones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mont%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Te perdiste un montón.","en":"You missed a lot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443411"},{"text":"Tengo montones de dinero.","en":"I have a ton of money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630309"},{"text":"Todos lloramos un montón.","en":"We all cried a lot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/819925"},{"text":"Tengo dinero a montones.","en":"I don't have tons of money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630308"},{"text":"Nos sacrificamos un montón.","en":"We sacrifice a lot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501265"}]}